{"seq":1,"slug":"rust-wasm-toolchain","title":"Rust 到 WebAssembly 工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/toolchains/rust-wasm-toolchain","wordCount":838,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"rust-到-webassembly-工具链\">Rust 到 WebAssembly 工具链</h1><p>Rust 是 2026 年 WebAssembly 开发的首选语言——无 GC、无运行时、内存安全、产物极小。wasm-pack 和 wasm-bindgen 两个核心工具将 Rust 代码编译为 .wasm 并自动生成 JS 绑定代码，开发者无需手动处理指针传递和内存分配。本篇从环境搭建到生产级优化，完整覆盖 Rust-to-Wasm 的实战工具链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Rust-to-Wasm 工具链围绕三个核心工具运转：rustc 将 Rust 编译为 .wasm 二进制、wasm-bindgen 在 Wasm 数值类型与 JS 高级类型之间架桥、wasm-pack 将编译/绑定生成/优化/发布封装为单一命令。cargo-component 则面向 Component Model 构建 WASI 0.2+ 组件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工具链全景\">工具链全景</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Rust 源码&lt;br/&gt;src/lib.rs] --&gt; B[rustc + wasm32-unknown-unknown]&#10;    B --&gt; C[原始 .wasm]&#10;    C --&gt; D[wasm-bindgen&lt;br/&gt;生成 JS 胶水代码]&#10;    D --&gt; E[pkg/&lt;br/&gt;.wasm + .js + .d.ts]&#10;    E --&gt; F[wasm-opt&lt;br/&gt;体积与性能优化]&#10;    F --&gt; G[最终产物&lt;br/&gt;可发布 npm]&#10;&#10;    H[wasm-pack] -.-&gt;|一键封装| B&#10;    H -.-&gt; D&#10;    H -.-&gt; F\">graph LR\n    A[Rust 源码&lt;br/&gt;src/lib.rs] --&gt; B[rustc + wasm32-unknown-unknown]\n    B --&gt; C[原始 .wasm]\n    C --&gt; D[wasm-bindgen&lt;br/&gt;生成 JS 胶水代码]\n    D --&gt; E[pkg/&lt;br/&gt;.wasm + .js + .d.ts]\n    E --&gt; F[wasm-opt&lt;br/&gt;体积与性能优化]\n    F --&gt; G[最终产物&lt;br/&gt;可发布 npm]\n\n    H[wasm-pack] -.-&gt;|一键封装| B\n    H -.-&gt; D\n    H -.-&gt; F</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>版本（2026）</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>rustup</code></td>\n<td>stable</td>\n<td>Rust 安装与目标管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wasm32-unknown-unknown</code></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>Wasm 编译目标（无 WASI，纯浏览器）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wasm32-wasip1</code> / <code>wasm32-wasip2</code></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>WASI Preview 1/2 目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wasm-pack</code></td>\n<td>0.14.0</td>\n<td>一站式构建、测试、发布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wasm-bindgen</code></td>\n<td>0.2.114</td>\n<td>Rust ↔ JS 类型桥接代码生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wasm-opt</code> (binaryen)</td>\n<td>120+</td>\n<td>二进制级优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cargo-component</code></td>\n<td>0.16+</td>\n<td>Component Model 组件构建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"环境搭建\">环境搭建</h2><p>三步即可开始 Rust-to-Wasm 开发：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 1. 安装 Rust 并添加 Wasm 目标&#10;rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown&#10;&#10;# 2. 安装 wasm-pack&#10;cargo install wasm-pack&#10;&#10;# 3. 创建项目&#10;wasm-pack new my-wasm-lib\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 安装 Rust 并添加 Wasm 目标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rustup</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> wasm32-unknown-unknown</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 安装 wasm-pack</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> wasm-pack</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. 创建项目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm-pack</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-wasm-lib</span></span></code></pre></div><p>项目的 <code>Cargo.toml</code> 需要声明 crate-type 为 <code>cdylib</code>（生成动态库格式的 .wasm）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"[lib]&#10;crate-type = [&quot;cdylib&quot;]&#10;&#10;[dependencies]&#10;wasm-bindgen = &quot;0.2&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[lib]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>crate-type = [\"cdylib\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[dependencies]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wasm-bindgen = \"0.2\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"wasm-bindgen-类型桥接的核心\">wasm-bindgen：类型桥接的核心</h2><p>wasm-bindgen 解决 Wasm 与 JS 之间的类型鸿沟——Wasm 只认数字，但 JS 有字符串、对象、数组。通过 <code>#[wasm_bindgen]</code> 属性宏，Rust 的高级类型被自动序列化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn process_text(input: &amp;str) -&gt; String {&#10;    format!(&quot;Processed: {}&quot;, input.to_uppercase())&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub struct ImageProcessor {&#10;    width: u32,&#10;    height: u32,&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;impl ImageProcessor {&#10;    #[wasm_bindgen(constructor)]&#10;    pub fn new(width: u32, height: u32) -&gt; Self {&#10;        Self { width, height }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pub fn pixel_count(&amp;self) -&gt; u32 {&#10;        self.width * self.height&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn process_text(input: &#x26;str) -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    format!(\"Processed: {}\", input.to_uppercase())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct ImageProcessor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    width: u32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    height: u32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl ImageProcessor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[wasm_bindgen(constructor)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn new(width: u32, height: u32) -> Self {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Self { width, height }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn pixel_count(&#x26;self) -> u32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.width * self.height</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>JS 端直接使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import init, { process_text, ImageProcessor } from &#39;./pkg/my_lib.js&#39;;&#10;&#10;await init();&#10;console.log(process_text(&#39;hello&#39;)); // &quot;Processed: HELLO&quot;&#10;&#10;const proc = new ImageProcessor(1920, 1080);&#10;console.log(proc.pixel_count()); // 2073600\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> init, { process_text, ImageProcessor } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './pkg/my_lib.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">process_text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hello'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// \"Processed: HELLO\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> proc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ImageProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1920</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1080</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(proc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pixel_count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2073600</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"类型映射表\">类型映射表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Rust 类型</th>\n<th>JS 类型</th>\n<th>传递方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>i32</code> / <code>u32</code> / <code>f64</code></td>\n<td><code>number</code></td>\n<td>直接值传递</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&amp;str</code> / <code>String</code></td>\n<td><code>string</code></td>\n<td>复制到 Wasm 线性内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Vec&lt;u8&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>Uint8Array</code></td>\n<td>零拷贝视图（借用时）或复制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>#[wasm_bindgen] struct</code></td>\n<td>JS class</td>\n<td>指针包装 + 析构绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>JsValue</code></td>\n<td>任意 JS 值</td>\n<td>externref 引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Result&lt;T, JsError&gt;</code></td>\n<td>正常值或 throw</td>\n<td>自动异常转换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"构建目标与集成方式\">构建目标与集成方式</h2><p>wasm-pack 提供三种构建目标：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 浏览器 ES Module（推荐 Vite/现代浏览器）&#10;wasm-pack build --target web --release&#10;&#10;# 打包工具（Webpack/Rollup/Vite plugin）&#10;wasm-pack build --target bundler --release&#10;&#10;# Node.js CommonJS&#10;wasm-pack build --target nodejs --release\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 浏览器 ES Module（推荐 Vite/现代浏览器）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm-pack</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> web</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 打包工具（Webpack/Rollup/Vite plugin）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm-pack</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bundler</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Node.js CommonJS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm-pack</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nodejs</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>产物格式</th>\n<th>初始化方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>web</code></td>\n<td>ES Module + init()</td>\n<td><code>import init from &#39;./pkg&#39;</code></td>\n<td>现代浏览器直接加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bundler</code></td>\n<td>ES Module (bare import)</td>\n<td>打包工具处理</td>\n<td>Vite/Webpack 项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>nodejs</code></td>\n<td>CommonJS</td>\n<td><code>require()</code></td>\n<td>服务端/CLI</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"web-sys-与-js-sys-浏览器-api-绑定\">web-sys 与 js-sys：浏览器 API 绑定</h2><p>Rust 生态为 Web API 提供了完整的类型安全绑定：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>js-sys</strong>：JavaScript 内置对象（Array、Date、Promise、JSON）</li>\n<li><strong>web-sys</strong>：Web 平台 API（DOM、Canvas、Fetch、WebSocket）</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use web_sys::{window, HtmlCanvasElement};&#10;use wasm_bindgen::JsCast;&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn get_canvas_size(id: &amp;str) -&gt; Vec&lt;u32&gt; {&#10;    let document = window().unwrap().document().unwrap();&#10;    let canvas = document&#10;        .get_element_by_id(id)&#10;        .unwrap()&#10;        .dyn_into::&lt;HtmlCanvasElement&gt;()&#10;        .unwrap();&#10;    vec![canvas.width(), canvas.height()]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use web_sys::{window, HtmlCanvasElement};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use wasm_bindgen::JsCast;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn get_canvas_size(id: &#x26;str) -> Vec&#x3C;u32> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let document = window().unwrap().document().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let canvas = document</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .get_element_by_id(id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .unwrap()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .dyn_into::&#x3C;HtmlCanvasElement>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec![canvas.width(), canvas.height()]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>web-sys 按 feature flag 按需引入，避免产物膨胀：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"[dependencies.web-sys]&#10;version = &quot;0.3&quot;&#10;features = [&quot;Window&quot;, &quot;Document&quot;, &quot;HtmlCanvasElement&quot;, &quot;CanvasRenderingContext2d&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[dependencies.web-sys]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>version = \"0.3\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>features = [\"Window\", \"Document\", \"HtmlCanvasElement\", \"CanvasRenderingContext2d\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"产物优化策略\">产物优化策略</h2><p>Rust 默认产物已经很小，但生产级部署还可以进一步压缩：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化手段</th>\n<th>节省幅度</th>\n<th>配置方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Release 模式 + LTO</td>\n<td>30-50%</td>\n<td><code>[profile.release] lto = true</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>opt-level = &#39;z&#39;</code></td>\n<td>额外 10-20%（体积优先）</td>\n<td>Cargo.toml</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wasm-opt -Oz</code></td>\n<td>额外 5-15%</td>\n<td>wasm-pack 自动调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移除 panic 信息</td>\n<td>10-30KB</td>\n<td><code>panic = &#39;abort&#39;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>去除调试符号</td>\n<td>视情况</td>\n<td><code>strip = true</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个典型的 JSON 解析库，经全部优化后产物约 15-30KB gzip——远小于等价 JS 库。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cargo-component-面向-component-model\">cargo-component：面向 Component Model</h2><p>2026 年，面向 WASI 0.2+ 和 Component Model 的项目使用 <code>cargo-component</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"cargo install cargo-component&#10;cargo component new my-service&#10;cargo component build --release\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cargo-component</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> component</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> component</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span></span></code></pre></div><p>它使用 WIT（WebAssembly Interface Types）文件定义组件接口，编译出符合 Component Model 规范的 .wasm 组件——可被 Wasmtime、Spin 等运行时直接加载。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>wasm-pack 是 Rust-to-Wasm 的一站式工具，封装了编译、绑定生成、优化和发布</li>\n<li>wasm-bindgen 通过宏自动桥接 Rust 类型与 JS 类型，消除手动内存管理</li>\n<li>三种构建目标（web/bundler/nodejs）覆盖所有集成场景</li>\n<li>web-sys/js-sys 提供类型安全的浏览器 API 访问</li>\n<li>LTO + wasm-opt + panic=abort 可将产物压缩到极致</li>\n<li>cargo-component 是面向 Component Model 的新一代构建工具</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"multi-language-compilation\">多语言编译方案</a>：Emscripten、AssemblyScript、Kotlin/Wasm 等非 Rust 路径</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../frontend-web-workers-parallelism/practice/worker-use-cases\">Web Workers 实战</a>：Wasm 模块在 Worker 中执行密集计算的模式</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Rust 到 WebAssembly 工具链","id":"rust-到-webassembly-工具链"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"工具链全景","id":"工具链全景"},{"level":2,"text":"环境搭建","id":"环境搭建"},{"level":2,"text":"wasm-bindgen：类型桥接的核心","id":"wasm-bindgen-类型桥接的核心"},{"level":3,"text":"类型映射表","id":"类型映射表"},{"level":2,"text":"构建目标与集成方式","id":"构建目标与集成方式"},{"level":2,"text":"web-sys 与 js-sys：浏览器 API 绑定","id":"web-sys-与-js-sys-浏览器-api-绑定"},{"level":2,"text":"产物优化策略","id":"产物优化策略"},{"level":2,"text":"cargo-component：面向 Component Model","id":"cargo-component-面向-component-model"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"类型系统扩展与标准提案","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/foundations/type-system-and-proposals"},"next":{"title":"多语言 WebAssembly 编译方案","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/toolchains/multi-language-compilation"}}